[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6840.629, "timestamp": "01:54:00", "text": "人看到我这样做，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6846.629, "timestamp": "01:54:06", "text": "你好。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6848.95, "timestamp": "01:54:08", "text": "他们试图打招呼。 但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6850.95, "timestamp": "01:54:10", "text": "没有回头。 我当时非常害羞。 我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6862.39, "timestamp": "01:54:22", "text": "我可能会养狗什么的。 我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6867.99, "timestamp": "01:54:27", "text": "想：“啊，我好害怕好害羞。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6870.629, "timestamp": "01:54:30", "text": "没错，我们又回到了这条大道上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6874.07, "timestamp": "01:54:34", "text": "。 所以，呃，就连马特城也晚上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6875.91, "timestamp": "01:54:35", "text": "8点关门。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6880.149, "timestamp": "01:54:40", "text": "我记得是晚上8点关门。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6882.55, "timestamp": "01:54:42", "text": "我本应该提前一个小时离开，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6887.03, "timestamp": "01:54:47", "text": "但我现在还在这里闲逛，因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6889.189, "timestamp": "01:54:49", "text": "迷路了。 明天我们还会再来，"}]